Wait, this lacks the `$min` filter. A filter after grouping needs the grouped relation drawn via `from`:

```gq
gq 3;
query big_employers($min: I64) {
  match {
    from { match { $c: Company  $p worksAt $c } return { $c, count($p) as n } }
    $n >= $min
  }
  return { $c.name, $n as n }
  order { n desc }
}
```

